OL,3,GNEWSARemembering the fallen from
OL,4,APenzance to Paddington
OL,5,
OL,6,FVeterans, serving military personnel
OL,7,Fand wreath bearers joined an Armistice
OL,8,FDay railway journey from Cornwall to
OL,9,FLondon as part of Remembrance
OL,10,Fcommemorations.
OL,12,FThe Poppies to Paddington train stopped
OL,13,Fat stations along the way - following
OL,14,Fin the footsteps of thousands of
OL,15,Fsoldiers who made the journey on their
OL,16,Fway to the front line.
OL,18,FThe service was one of a number of
OL,19,Ftrains carrying wreaths to the war
OL,20,Fmemorial at Paddington's Platform One.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
