OL,3,GNEWSARemembering the fallen from
OL,4,APenzance to Paddington
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne passenger was Margot Billinge,
OL,7,Fdaughter of Harry Billinge MBE, a D-Day
OL,8,Fveteran from St Austell, who said: "The
OL,9,Ffirst poppy train in 2020 my dad put
OL,10,Fthe wreath on the train...I now have
OL,11,Fthe privilege of doing that for him."
